<h1>Delete Your Account</h1>
<p class="effective">FormCompass AI</p>

<p>You can permanently delete your FormCompass AI account and all associated data directly from within the app, at any time.</p>

<h2>How to delete your account (in the app)</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Open FormCompass AI and sign in.</li>
  <li>Tap the credit balance in the top right corner to open your account/plan screen.</li>
  <li>Scroll to the <strong>Account</strong> section at the bottom.</li>
  <li>Tap <strong>Delete my account</strong>, then confirm.</li>
</ol>

<div class="highlight">
<p><strong>This immediately and permanently deletes:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Your account and login credentials</li>
  <li>Your remaining analysis credits</li>
  <li>Every video you've uploaded</li>
  <li>All of your past analysis results</li>
</ul>
<p>This action cannot be undone.</p>
</div>

<h2>If you can't access the app</h2>
<p>If you're unable to sign in or use the app for any reason, you can still request deletion of your account and data by emailing us at <a href="mailto:support@formcompassai.com">support@formcompassai.com</a> from the email address associated with your account. We'll confirm your identity and process the deletion promptly.</p>

<h2>What happens to data held by third-party services</h2>
<p>Deleting your account also removes your uploaded videos and processing artifacts from the third-party services we use to run analyses (as described in our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>). Some cached copies held by these processing services may persist for a short period before being automatically removed.</p>

<div class="contact">
<p><strong>Questions?</strong> Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@formcompassai.com">support@formcompassai.com</a>.</p>
